    given-names: Kelechi Emeka
    email: kelechiogbonna300@gmail.com
    alias: cloudynirvana
repository-code: "https://github.com/cloudynirvana/research-theses-hub"
url: "https://github.com/cloudynirvana/research-theses-hub"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-09-21"
abstract: >-
  Catalog of thesis-worthy computational research by Kelechi Emeka
  Ogbonna: dedicated landing repos for theses 00–07 (wet-lab B.Sc. papaya
  AgNP; CONFLUENCE × OnCo; Complexity Science / NSTG-guided in-silico
  pathology; Disease Profile method; occult hybrid switching; metastasis
  on anatomical graphs; sparse connectome-style controllers; TNBC
  ATP–ROS–glucose identifiability), working drafts in project-confluence
  manuscripts, and related software with honest labels. Research /
  in-silico only for 01–07. Not a medical device, not clinical decision
  support, not a dose, and not a cure. No document DOI. Institutional
  email pending. Google Scholar and ResearchGate indexing are manual
  later steps.
keywords:
  - computational oncology
  - in-silico research
  - research catalog
  - knowledge gates
  - disease profile
  - complexity science
  - not a medical device
